{'id': 2065712, 'url': 'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/project-management/sr-project-manager-2065712', 'title': 'Sr. Project Manager', 'company_name': 'Tek Systems', 'company_logo': 'https://remotive.com/job/2065712/logo', 'category': 'Project Management', 'tags': ['fullstack', 'project management', 'insurance'], 'job_type': 'full_time', 'publication_date': '2025-09-25T02:51:04', 'candidate_required_location': 'USA', 'salary': 'usd 70 per hour', 'description': '<p>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;Job Description :
	Manage the TEK Construction market team ensuring clear communication and direction and all related processes, procedures and related information meet expectations.
	Day-to-day customer leadership relationship.
	Leader / mentor in day-to-day operations to remove interference and resistance; provide insight and guidance to the team and client as required.
	Assist in the resolution of Client and vendor / GC escalations.

Essential Job Functions:
	Responsible for the effective management of all assigned small cell projects and their associated schedules, including all deliverables associated
	Ensure that the Client is aware of issues that will impact timely project completions and affect overall target run rates. Pro-actively seek to identify and apply solutions to ensure overall plan volumes remain successful&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;Project management, Wireless Construction, Project Tracking, Program management&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top Skills Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;Project management,Wireless Construction,Project Tracking&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Skills &amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;Key Tasks:
	Lead external deployment meetings with GCs / vendors  to schedule effectively, report progress  and manage associated items (CoP, RMA, Outage CRs etc.). Target of 50 power and 50 RAN upgrades per week
	Attend client meetings and provide client with status reports as required / defined. Escalate appropriately into client and pro-actively resolve any conflicts or issues
	Ensure that all data is maintained in the designated project trackers with complete accuracy.
	Work with client teams to ensure a clean hand off for every project into the GCs active schedules. 
	Manage outage notifications to ensure every scheduled upgrade has an approved CR / outage in client and customer systems (ServiceNow and PIER) – Target no aging RMA TTs
	CoP management and reporting to ensure  all CoP are submitted within 5-7 days&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
					&lt;p&gt;Expert Level&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pay range for this position is $70.00 - $70.00/hr.&lt;p&gt;Eligibility requirements apply to some benefits and may depend on your job&lt;br /&gt;            classification and length of employment. Benefits are subject to change and may be&lt;br /&gt;            subject to specific elections, plan, or program terms. If eligible, the benefits&lt;br /&gt;            available for this temporary role may include the following:&lt;p&gt;            • Medical, dental &amp; vision&lt;br /&gt;            • Critical Illness, Accident, and Hospital&lt;br /&gt;            • 401(k) Retirement Plan – Pre-tax and Roth post-tax contributions available&lt;br /&gt;            • Life Insurance (Voluntary Life &amp; AD&amp;D for the employee and dependents)&lt;br /&gt;            • Short and long-term disability&lt;br /&gt;            • Health Spending Account (HSA)&lt;br /&gt;            • Transportation benefits&lt;br /&gt;            • Employee Assistance Program&lt;br /&gt;            • Time Off/Leave (PTO, Vacation or Sick Leave)&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position.&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;This position is anticipated to close on Sep 29, 2025.&lt;p&gt;h4&gt;About TEKsystems:

&lt;p&gt;We're partners in transformation. We help clients activate ideas and solutions to take advantage of a new world of opportunity. We are a team of 80,000 strong, working with over 6,000 clients, including 80% of the Fortune 500, across North America, Europe and Asia. As an industry leader in Full-Stack Technology Services, Talent Services, and real-world application, we work with progressive leaders to drive change. That's the power of true partnership. TEKsystems is an Allegis Group company. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The company is an equal opportunity employer and will consider all applications without regards to race, sex, age, color, religion, national origin, veteran status, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information or any characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;About TEKsystems and TEKsystems Global Services &lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We’re a leading provider of business and technology services. We accelerate business transformation for our customers. Our expertise in strategy, design, execution and operations unlocks business value through a range of solutions. We’re a team of 80,000 strong, working with over 6,000 customers, including 80% of the Fortune 500 across North America, Europe and Asia, who partner with us for our scale, full-stack capabilities and speed. We’re strategic thinkers, hands-on collaborators, helping customers capitalize on change and master the momentum of technology. We’re building tomorrow by delivering business outcomes and making positive impacts in our global communities. TEKsystems and TEKsystems Global Services are Allegis Group companies. Learn more at TEKsystems.com.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The company is an equal opportunity employer and will consider all applications without regard to race, sex, age, color, religion, national origin, veteran status, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information or any characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;

</p><img src="https://remotive.com/job/track/2065712/blank.gif?source=public_api" alt=""/>'}

